00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:02.260
Why do you think I walk down
that street every single day

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:04.840
without actually anything to do there...

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:04.840
So you got your club?

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:07.970
Yeah! We suddenly got
called to the director's office,

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:06.580
Sneaky sneak...

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:10.260
so I was worried she'd tell us no, but...

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:12.140
Apparently the fact that

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:17.270
we got a special award despite it being
our first performance was in our favor.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:20.110
We got tons of new followers, too! Look!

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:21.980
Wow! Two thousand?!

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:25.820
And the director said we could
use the roof for practice!

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:27.450
"Following"
"Followers"

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:43.550
Here are your keys to your club room.

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:45.510
Th-Thanks.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.010
Um...

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:51.680
We'll do our best.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:54.350
We'll do our best and
make a name for ourselves

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:57.810
so we can make this school proud.
Then maybe you'll--

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:02.360
Then do anything other than
be school idols.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:04.110
I'd be more than happy to support you

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.700
in anything other than being school idols.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.820
We're not changing our minds.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:15.410
After singing on that stage, I realized
how wonderful school idols are.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:18.540
We're going to practice even more
and put on an even better show.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.880
We want to sing even better songs.

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:26.260
Unfortunately, I highly doubt you'd
be able to win at the current Love Live.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.050
Sneaky, sneaky, sneaky, sneak.

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:36.180
What are school idols?

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:39.480
Idols who perform at school...

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:41.810
So basically amateurs.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:45.190
♬ A shooting star races through ♬

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:45.190
This is from the other day.

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:48.900
♬ We chase after it and become stars ♬

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:51.530
So they were school idols. In that case...

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:51.530
♬ We won't stop... ♬

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:55.620
Let's see... 4-B. 4-B...

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:57.370
Is it really this way?

00:04:57.370 --> 00:05:00.830
All the other club rooms are
in the new school building...

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:04.340
Yeah. When I looked at the map,
it said it was over here.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:06.880
But I wonder why we have two keys.

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:08.380
I found it.

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:13.970
School Idol Club

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:14.470
School... Idol Club?

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:17.480
I wonder if the director
put this sign here.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:20.850
This place sure looks old...

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:26.440
I wouldn't be surprised
if there were ghosts.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:28.440
Are you scared, Kanon?

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:29.950
Of course not!

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.910
But before we open it...

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:35.620
You... saw... me...

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.870
Stop messing around!

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:42.630
Sorry, my bad. You just got so scared.

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:43.880
Someone's here.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.130
No way!

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:52.590
Excuse me...

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:54.140
Who are you?

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.010
I'm...

00:05:57.010 --> 00:05:58.680
Don't worry! She's got feet!

00:05:58.680 --> 00:05:59.810
Really?

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:03.020
Heanna-<i>san</i>?

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:07.570
I heard this was the club room
for the School Idol Club.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:09.860
Did you need something?

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:15.780
Well... You see, I'm a bit curious
about school idols.

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:18.080
You're curious? Wait, doesn't at mean...

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.540
Do you wish to join?

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:22.080
Not exactly. I just wanted
to hear about it.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.920
School idols are magnificent!
They're the best!

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.590
Filled with the brilliance of youth
and they're the best in the universe!

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:30.840
Just write your name here
and your class here and you, too,

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:33.130
can be a school idol starting today!

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.510
Keke-<i>chan</i>...

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:36.550
Let's rewind just a bit.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.470
Whoa.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:43.640
This is even more amazing
than what I saw before...

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:45.900
Such a huge stage.

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:49.190
Yes! This is the stage
for the finals at Love Live.

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:51.440
So many people come to watch!

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:54.700
If we make it here,
we'll be famous, right?

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:58.370
But of course! Sunny Passion won
last year, and they're currently--

