00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.830
98,000... Galaxy!

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.250
Galaxy?

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.760
I'm in. I'm absolutely, totally
going to do it. I'll be a school idol.

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:11.630
Are you sure?

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:14.300
Yes. Let's do our best together.

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:17.350
Now you have three.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.480
It's so huge!

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:26.400
I never knew this place existed.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.440
We could practice
with so many people here!

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:32.150
So... What did you want me to do?

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:36.110
Well... Let's start off with
some simple steps.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:40.910
Can you do that?

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:46.170
Wow...

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.210
You're so good!

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:51.630
Yeah. Looks like you've got
the basics down. Then how about this?

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.260
That's nothing.

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:55.840
Wow...

00:07:55.840 --> 00:08:00.050
Is this what they mean when
someone can think on their feet?

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:01.510
Probably.

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:04.390
Wait... Did you always
want to be a school idol?

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:07.400
Huh? Not exactly.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:10.650
I... just used to be in show business.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:12.150
Show business...

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:14.190
Wait... like TV?

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:15.990
Yeah, a few times.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:16.820
No way...

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:21.990
This is fate! This is destiny!
We're destined to win the Love Live!

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:26.080
Well, I did see watch some videos
of the group who won the Love Live

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.080
and I figured I could beat them.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:32.670
Really? I thought it was
totally impossible.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:36.420
So... About the center.

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:37.430
Center?

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:41.300
Yes. You're a group,
so you'll need a center.

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:44.270
Oh, right. It was just
the two of us the other day,

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:46.020
so I didn't really think about that.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:49.850
I guess we will have to decide that
if it becomes the three of us.

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:53.520
I mean, there are various ways
you can go about this...

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:54.610
I choose Kanon.

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:58.780
But it's best if
the best dancer and singer...

00:08:58.780 --> 00:08:59.740
Huh?

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:01.240
I choose Kanon!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:04.910
Yeah, I think Kanon-<i>chan</i>
should be the center, too.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:09.460
Kanon-<i>chan</i>'s the only option.
The one who created this group is...

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:11.130
Yes, it was Kanon.

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:14.130
Hold up!

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:17.130
I-Is it really that simple?

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:18.420
What do you mean?

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:20.720
The past and future don't really matter.

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:23.720
If you want to win, you need someone
with experience and talent in the center.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.470
Isn't that obvious?

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:26.640
Exactly.

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:29.890
But that's not all it takes
to be a center.

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:33.440
You also need something like charisma
that you can't see with your eyes.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:38.400
That might be true, but how do you
measure something like that?

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:45.890
"School Idol Center Elections!!"

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:44.330
We are currently holding an election
at the School Idol Club

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:46.370
to decide who should be the center.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:51.210
Please vote for whoever you think
should represent our school!

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:52.750
This is embarrassing.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:56.090
Well, you're a school idol now.

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:03.090
Don't worry. This isn't like
an audition or getting scouted.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:06.430
I just have to beat these two.
That should be...

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:09.560
No way...

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.560
Sumire

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.560
Keke

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.560
Kanon

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.560
Voting Results

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:10.980
No way...

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:13.520
See? I knew they'd pick Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:25.810
"Congrats on being the center! - Kanon"

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.650
Exactly what I thought!

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:18.150
Why don't you become
the club president, too?

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:22.200
What? Wait a sec. That seems a bit...

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.330
I won't accept this.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.000
I absolutely, totally
will not accept this!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.460
Why, though? I'm totally better than you
in both singing and dancing.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:38.840
This is what everyone decided
after you girls showed your stuff.

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:41.170
Probably something with aura... Flair...

00:10:41.170 --> 00:10:45.340
Kanon seems more like
the center than you and me.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:54.650
I quit.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:59.320
Hmph. If I can't be the center,
there's no point in me being here.

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:02.650
Wait... Sumire-<i>chan</i>?

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.530
Ow!

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:06.240
Sumire-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:25.510
We're not going to be able to
practice today at this rate.

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:26.800
Let's go home.

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:30.720
Chi-<i>chan</i>, thanks for always
spending so much time with us.

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:34.640
I want to help you two out!
Don't even worry about it.

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:36.310
Well, see you two later.

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:40.440
What?

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:45.110
I mean, if we let her be the center,
Sumire-<i>chan </i>won't leave.

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:47.030
Then let's let her do it.

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:49.120
I'm not so sure about that...

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:51.830
Every school idol
dreams of being the center.

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:53.910
You should be proud.

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:58.210
I wonder why Sumire-<i>chan</i>
seems so obsessed about that...

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:21.190
What is she doing?

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:25.030
Excuse me...

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:26.150
Yes?

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:28.030
Do you know where the station is?

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:32.030
Don't talk to me if you're not a scout!

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:38.170
A scout?

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:57.770
♬ Isopod... Isopod... ♬

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:01.900
♬ Iso, iso, iso, isopod... ♬

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:04.070
♬ Isopod... ♬

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:07.320
That's so cute. So that's
show business, huh?

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:13.030
You... saw... it...

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:16.580
S-Sumire-<i>chan</i>?

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:22.710
No!

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:27.010
<i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:37.220
Where... Huh? What the heck?

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:39.020
What's...

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:40.310
What is this?!

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:45.480
Good morning.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.030
Sumire-<i>chan</i>...?

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:52.030
You saw something that
you shouldn't have seen. And so...

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:54.120
...you'll just have to forget it.

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:57.450
Those clothes...
Wait, are you from a shrine...

00:13:57.450 --> 00:14:01.040
Don't worry. It'll be over quickly
if you just stay still.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:04.210
Let's see... "Once you've gotten this far,

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:08.170
you will beat your target over the head
a hundred times to make them forget"...

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.510
You're on-the-spot learning?!

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:13.700
The
 Rules 
to
 Curses

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:14.010
"Next, dump two liters of holy water
on them, tie them up"...

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:14.970
Hold up!

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:16.260
Quiet!

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:21.810
Wh-What's going on?
I can't seem to remember anything.

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:31.860
♬ Isopod... Isopod... ♬

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:35.990
♬ Iso, iso, iso, isopod... ♬

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:40.200
♬ Isopod... Isopod... ♬

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:44.040
♬ Iso, iso, iso, isopod... ♬

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:44.040
I'm sorry, I lied.
It's stuck in my head.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:48.210
I'm sure it is. Don't worry.
I'll put you out of your misery.

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:51.340
Wait, wait, wait! I won't tell anyone.
I promise I won't!

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:55.010
You tracked me all the way here.
Like I can trust you.

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:57.140
I didn't track you here.

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:01.770
I was just wondering why
you want to be the center so badly.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:09.940
Can I get this good luck charm?

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:13.900
So this is where I was locked up?

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:14.910
Here.

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.410
Thanks.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.290
It's exactly what it looks like.

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:30.710
Ever since I was little,
I did a bunch of auditions,

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:33.010
because I wanted to be the star.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:36.840
I worked really hard
when I was a child actress...

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:42.310
But no matter how hard I tried,
I would always end up with a small role.

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:42.310
♬ Isopod... Isopod... ♬

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:45.560
So that's why you wanted to be the center.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:46.770
Yeah.

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:50.480
You guys are amateurs,
so I figured I'd have the upper hand.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:52.780
But I guess not.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:55.150
You don't know for sure though.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:58.490
No, this settles it.

00:15:58.490 --> 00:16:02.500
It just wasn't meant to be with me.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:08.330
No matter how hard I try,
I'll never be able to shine in the center.

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:12.920
Tell the other two that I'm sorry.

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:19.850
She thought she'd have the upper hand
against school idols...

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:21.640
I beg your pardon?

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:22.810
Keke-<i>chan</i>?

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:27.060
That is absolutely insulting
to school idols! Blasphemy!

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:30.110
Well, Sumire-<i>chan </i>did apologize...

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:33.860
I thought she was serious,
but she tricked me!

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:35.820
I shall punish her!

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:36.820
Punish...?

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:42.080
First, I'll start with ice down her back,
then about ten minutes of tickling...

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.670
Wait.

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:51.130
Get your ass to the roof
at lunchtime... please.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:55.880
Didn't you hear? I'm not interested
in school idols any...

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:58.130
Your ass better be there... please.

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:02.930
What are we going to do?

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:11.560
You're late!

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:12.860
What did you want?

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:15.570
You insulted school idols.

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:19.410
So I shall punish you
on behalf of all the school idols.

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:22.740
What? I apologized already.

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:27.790
Do you know how serious school idols
work to stand on that stage?

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:31.170
And you had the nerve to say
you'd have the upper hand?

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:35.590
There.

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:37.170
Sumire-<i>chan</i>...

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:42.800
I worked so hard to do that dance.

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:45.770
Don't underestimate show business.

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:48.020
This is nothing.

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:50.900
Even then, the spotlight
will never shine down on me.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:53.270
Even in this world of amateurs.

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:56.730
We are not amateurs!

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:59.070
Again?

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:01.450
Move.

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.710
School idols, right?

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:13.250
Yeah, apparently they're
practicing on the roof.

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:18.670
Why did you open up the roof to them?

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.760
Because there was nowhere else.

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:21.880
But...

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:24.760
They are clearly working hard,
so I don't believe

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:27.310
that we should take away
their opportunity to grow.

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:30.940
Don't you think that's
what your mother would say?

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:39.940
I guess it's not going to stop.

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:42.150
What are you going to do
about Sumire-<i>chan</i>?

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:43.450
Well...

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.620
I get how she feels,

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:48.330
because I thought the same thing
when I couldn't sing.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:52.670
That it was my fate.
There's no point in trying.

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:54.960
But that wasn't really the case, right?

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:55.840
Yeah...

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:58.340
Then I think you need to tell her.

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:05.090
No matter how hard I try,
I'll never be able to shine in the center.

00:19:05.090 --> 00:19:08.970
Right now, the one who can understand
Sumire-<i>chan </i>the most is...

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:24.320
I guess people really don't
show up when it's raining.

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:25.320
Next up,

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:27.030
we have a song from the winners of
the special newcomer award,

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:28.950
Kuukaa!

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:31.160
♬ This shining shooting star ♬

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:34.790
♬ We chase after it and become stars ♬

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:41.420
♬ We won't stop, we can't stop,
even if we're still small ♬

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:44.880
♬ Because we want to continue dreaming ♬

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:49.350
♬ The same dream together forever ♬

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:55.310
♬ Let's hold our hands together tightly
and go, Tiny Stars ♬

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:54.770
I just...

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:57.480
Found you!

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:59.520
♬ Sparkle! ♬

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.520
I figured you'd be here.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:01.320
You're so persistent.

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:03.320
I wanted to talk to you.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.820
Sumire Heanna-<i>san</i>...

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:10.620
Here's my card!

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:12.370
Yuigaoka Girls' High School Idol Club
Kanon Shibuya

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:13.620
Huh?

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:17.830
Sumire-<i>san</i>, I've come to scout you!

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.920
In order for us to continue
being school idols,

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.090
we need to produce worthy results.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:28.720
I want you to help us out with your
show business wisdom and techniques.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:30.760
I told you, I'm--

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:33.640
If you want the center position,
come take it from me.

00:20:34.930 --> 00:20:40.400
When I saw you, I decided that
I wanted to be center.

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:42.360
So come take it from me.

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:46.610
I think if we compete over it,
it'll also help the group.

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:48.780
Don't mock me. You saw me.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:51.280
I was actually in show business.

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:53.120
There's no way I'd lose
to a newbie amateur--

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.200
Then prove it.

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:59.790
How much?

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:01.920
I'm asking you how much
you're going to pay!

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:05.420
If you're going to scout me,
I obviously need my down payment.

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:06.970
Why would--

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:08.050
I have it.

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:15.220
That's from my shrine...

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:16.520
How about that?

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:23.900
This doesn't work at all.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.360
Really?

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:27.070
I mean...

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:29.200
Oh, it's the same.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:34.160
But we don't know for sure yet.

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:44.420
As long as you don't give up,
your dream just might be further up ahead.

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:51.050
It's sunny!

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:52.090
It's summer!

00:21:52.090 --> 00:21:53.850
Woohoo!

00:21:58.810 --> 00:22:02.270
All right, let's begin.

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:04.230
Sumire-<i>chan</i>!

00:22:04.230 --> 00:22:06.690
Starting today, I'll teach you...

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:11.860
...the real world of show business!

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:14.990
Galaxy!

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:18.910
<i>The future is calling to us</i>

00:22:18.910 --> 00:22:21.750
<i>Like the wind</i>

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:27.960
<i>No one knows what the future holds for us</i>

00:22:29.380 --> 00:22:32.300
<i>Even then, we want to move forward</i>

00:22:32.300 --> 00:22:35.810
<i>Because we don't want to have any regrets</i>

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:39.430
<i>You can't hold down our hearts</i>

00:22:39.430 --> 00:22:43.600
<i>Let's all be free</i>

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:47.070
<i>We're not going to give up!</i>

00:22:47.070 --> 00:22:50.650
<i>Because we decided that</i>

00:22:50.650 --> 00:22:53.700
<i>We'll cry, laugh, and do our best</i>

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:58.040
<i>We all want to surpass our limits</i>

00:22:58.040 --> 00:23:02.290
<i>It's important to believe</i>

00:23:02.290 --> 00:23:05.840
<i>And once we told ourselves that</i>

00:23:05.840 --> 00:23:12.840
<i>Let's try to go even further</i>

00:23:12.840 --> 00:23:20.600
<i>We may be small, but we have big dreams</i>

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:27.690
<i>We won't give in, now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:27.690 --> 00:23:35.280
<i>Let's fly the best we can,</i>
<i>now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:40.980
Passion Island

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:40.980
Passion Island

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:40.620
Next time, "Passion Island."
